&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2531&quot; data-local-id=&quot;5ebb48414c73&quot;&gt;Bachelor’s, Master’s or &lt;span data-highlighted=&quot;true&quot; data-vc=&quot;highlighted-text&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;_1mT5xdRAKS&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;_0nmozVaHVx _2V7sgO2M4S _3BoeIDwZ7G _30zrXRyxdf _0ReiIH7zJH&quot; data-testid=&quot;definition-highlighter&quot;&gt;PhD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt; degree in Computer Science, Computer Engineering or equivalent, with outstanding academic achievements&lt;/p&gt;
