&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot;&gt;At GWI we&#39;re always looking for extraordinary people who thrive on making an extraordinary impact. Right now we&#39;re looking for a &lt;strong&gt;Senior Insight Manager&lt;/strong&gt; to play a key role in our &lt;strong&gt;Insight Services&lt;/strong&gt; team in London. If that&#39;s you, and making a difference gets you out of bed in the morning, keep reading. It could be the start of something, well, extraordinary.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 class=&quot;text-text-100 mt-3 -mb-1 text-[1.375rem] font-bold&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;Sounds great, what will I be doing? 🤔&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot;&gt;As our Senior Insight Manager you&#39;ll lead a team of analysts focused on uncovering data-driven narratives that shape how brands understand and engage their audiences. You&#39;ll oversee large-scale reporting projects, transforming GWI&#39;s rich datasets into compelling insights, reports, and presentations that surface the unexpected and sharpen client strategy. You&#39;ll also partner closely with Revenue teams, contributing to RFPs and proposals to support a strong pipeline of new opportunities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot;&gt;A few things you&#39;ll be responsible for:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot;&gt;👉 Lead and develop a team of analysts — overseeing deliverables for accuracy, quality, and efficiency while supporting their growth and development.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot;&gt;👉 Lead large-scale reporting projects for our biggest clients, surfacing trends and stories that align with their objectives.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot;&gt;👉 Own RFP and proposal responses to showcase GWI&#39;s insight capabilities and support pipeline growth — including running client presentations, meetings, and workshops.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot;&gt;It&#39;s also fun; shaking things up is what working for GWI is all about. You&#39;ll need to be flexible, comfortable with continuous change, and working in a high-tempo environment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 class=&quot;text-text-100 mt-3 -mb-1 text-[1.375rem] font-bold&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;What do I need to bring with me? 🧳&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot;&gt;You&#39;ll need to be able to demonstrate the core skills this role requires. You don&#39;t have to tick all the boxes right away; the important thing is that you&#39;re willing to learn. Here&#39;s what the team will be looking for in you:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot;&gt;👉 Proven experience managing projects and senior client relationships.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot;&gt;👉 A talent for data storytelling — translating numbers into narratives and surfacing insights that challenge assumptions or reveal something new.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot;&gt;👉 Exceptional attention to detail and a flair for writing clear, engaging content.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot;&gt;👉 Proficiency in Microsoft Office and Google Slides; comfortable running client presentations, workshops, and meetings.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot;&gt;👉 Demonstrated line management experience, with a track record of developing analysts and managing team performance.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot;&gt;Equally important is attitude. We want people who think big (to make an impact), ask why (to find a better way), and show respect (to everyone, at every level, all the time). Those are our values, and they&#39;re a big part of what we&#39;re looking for in you.&lt;/p&gt;
